        "Evidence and proposal must match by typed field, scope and source hash; no unsupported invented value. Encrypted private draft only, not shared Task/Record.",
        "Inventory quantity is integral; opening_balance permits 0; purchase/consumption require >=1. These are past-event bookkeeping, never ordering.",
        "Finance amounts use exact integer minor units per explicit currency; do not net currencies, infer missing balances, or count receipt and imported transaction as separate confirmed expenses without review.",
        "Digest binds draft_id, immutable revision, kind, canonical data, source hash, and schema version. Acceptance cannot change payload under same digest.",
        "Creation changes no live balance, deadline verification/completion, financial total, career profile or schedule."
