              "record_count"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "server_enforcement": [
        "Read only owner-confirmed immutable imported rows; proposed receipts do not affect totals. Dataset ID is owner-checked before decryption.",
        "Group exact amounts by currency; balance snapshots are not income/expenses. Distinguish missing data from zero.",
        "No bank sign-in, payments, trades, provider writeback or credentials. No automatic link between finance receipts and ammunition records."
      ]
    },
