            "format": "uuid"
          }
        }
      },
      "server_enforcement": [
        "Require current verified incomplete deadline with matching digest; reject stale candidate, ambiguous needs_review or completion.",
        "remind_at must be explicitly user-selected (or an already human-approved reminder preference); do not calculate any legal date in Stage 1; later renewal automation is gated on reviewed official jurisdiction-specific rules and required user dates. Validate IANA zone and offset.",
        "Draft only. Human UI acceptance is required before creating a schedule. No email, Slack, shared calendar or lock-screen sensitive details.",
        "Future worker revalidates candidate, generation, owner and completion before delivery; recurrence/run/delivery states are separate and unknown delivery is not blindly resent."
      ]
    }
